  "title": "Saints Wide Receiver Jarvis Landry Reacts To Saint Fans Band Cutting Up In Atlanta Walmart [Watch]",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":518322,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/usatsi_18414805_168388561_lowres-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-518322\"/><figcaption>USA Today Sports </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After the <a href=\"https://oddsseeker.com/news/week-one-nfl-recap-who-s-hot-and-who-s-not\">Atlanta Falcons</a> lost to the New Orleans Saints 27-26 at home in Mercedes-Benz Stadium, the New Orleans Saints fans were cutting up at a local Walmart in Atlanta. In a video posted by MIA X, The Mama of Southern Gangsta Music Creator of  Team Whip Dem Pots, with the caption, \"All in Atlanta Walmart. <gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/TheRealMiaX/status/1569076445061779456?s=20u0026t=Ikw6Psbuoy1sDSxKi_lc7w\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/TheRealMiaX/status/1569076445061779456?s=20&amp;t=Ikw6Psbuoy1sDSxKi_lc7w\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the video the Saints fans were in the store playing music with instruments and celebrating after beating their division rivals. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After seeing the video, Saints wide receiver, Jarvis Landry reacted to the clip.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"That’s Wild <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/WHODAT?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1569104179192561664%7Ctwgr%5Eb27a00ef2aa8a0066973495681d7b3be95e813b2%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Flandonbuford.com%2Fwp-admin%2Fpost.php%3Fpost%3D518320action%3Dedit&amp;src=hashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">#WHODAT</a>,\" Landry tweeted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/God_Son80/status/1569104179192561664?s=20u0026t=AZMdwNFvXJdeafYUVYlxvQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/God_Son80/status/1569104179192561664?s=20&amp;t=AZMdwNFvXJdeafYUVYlxvQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Landry finished the game on Sunday with seven catches with 114 yards and averaged 16.3 yards per catch. Also, after the game, the <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/09/11/fight-breaks-out-between-saints-and-falcons-fans-after-saints-wins-watch/\">Saints fans and Falcons fans had a brawl</a> in the stadium's concourse. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The rematch between the Saints and Falcons in New Orleans is on December 18 at the Caesars Superdome. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
